   "date": "2023-03-30",
   "stage_hint": null,
   "brief": "The government introduced the Constitution Alteration (Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Voice) Bill 2023, proposing a referendum to alter the Constitution to establish an Aboriginal and Torres Strait Islander Voice, giving Indigenous Australians a say in matters affecting them."
